# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows runners (and Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true)
# get a CRLF working tree, and `gofmt -l` then reports every Go file as
# unformatted because Go source is defined to use LF. That is what broke CI
# on the first push: 26 files listed, none of them actually misformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git should never touch.
*.exe binary
*.syso binary
*.pyz binary
*.pyc binary
*.zip binary
